				<wikidot:authorName>toadking07</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1632267</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Oh, the bureaucracy is almost my most favorite part about it all! Everything is tested, listed, ordered, numbered, checked and double checked. Somehow the strange, mind numbing, violent things contained become comically dull compared to the horror of the mountain of paper work that must go along with them. It's hilarious and so darn odd; it's great.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
